    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "不是啊，明天打算出去吃，十二點旺角地鐵站恒生銀行。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "02-blush",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "呀，芷君你開會開到三點嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "zhijun",
      "expr": "03-glare",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "是呀。你不行嗎？也要開會？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "凌晨打給素婷：怎麼不在中大？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "04-cold",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "改做晚飯可不可以一餐一次過請？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "zhijun",
      "expr": "05-tearsmile",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "你還真是好吝嗇啊！鬼才等你的晚飯，我可是要回家跟家人吃的啦。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "05-fire",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "那麼，至少給我一點時間趕過來……"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "suting",
      "expr": "01-smile",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "跟家綸慶祝，吃得豪氣一點不好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "zhijun",
      "expr": "04-puff",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "你也要開會甚麼的吧？何時開完會？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "01-shrug",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "我也不知道。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "zhijun",
      "expr": "01-laugh",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "我不管你喔。總之明天三時給我到 coffee corner 來，別忘了你還欠我錢啊。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "01-shrug",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "這樣嘛……我想想看……"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "suting",
      "expr": "02-sigh",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "等等，會長剛剛發訊息來。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "02-blush",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "他說甚麼？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "zhijun",
      "expr": "02-hips",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "zhijun",
      "text": "想完了沒有？我不等了，我要掛線了啦。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "zhijun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "04-cold",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "等多一會。一會兒就好。"
    },
